#. i18n: file: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml
#: rc.cpp:3946 rc.cpp:4006
#, fuzzy, kde-format
#| msgid ""
#| "<![CDATA[How bright (<code>R+G+B</code>) does a pixel need to be in order "
#| "to be recognized as a light source?<br/>\n"
#| "            Increasing this threshold requires brighter light sources (i."
#| "e. more white or less color, respectively) but prevents some «false "
